    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Anthropic Claude is an API only family, with 15 versions listed and no open weights, so you cannot self host any of them. All 15 support reasoning, and context windows run from 200000 to 1000000 tokens, with the newest versions reaching 1000000 and 128000 max output. Prices vary widely by tier, from $1 input and $5 output per million for Haiku 4.5 up to $10 and $50 for Fable 5.1, while Sonnet 5.5 sits at $2 and $10. Inputs accept file, image and text, outputs are text only. Named results include LiveBench scores of 80.8 for Fable 5 and 80.3 for Opus 5, and an LMArena first place for Fable 5. The family suits long document and image work with reasoning, but the top tiers are costly and closed.",
